{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1147265-visits-from-social-services","id":1147265,"title":"Visits from social services.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-05T17:57:15-07:00","id":1147265,"title":"Visits from social services.","content":"Wondered on this for a bit, if you use persuasion, or Sovereign on a Social worker, they might as individuals be convinced...<br /> <br /> But orders to remove someone from their parents custody, still exist, and their just going to send someone else, and will be tipped off 'their deeply charismatic and manipulative, possibly sociopaths'<br /> <br /> Ideeas how garou, changelings, or mages could respond?<br /> <br /> Or ANY supernatural that has a run in with a social worker?<br /> <br /> Imbued, &quot;Romani&quot; , how could any of them respond, the &quot;Rom&quot; Have the problem from blood purity, so they need a prox, or enchantment.<br /> <br /> <br /> Is it safe to say, that the best solution for changelings, is often relocation to a out of the way freehold?<br /> <br /> Black spiral dancers are most likely to just slow things down a bit with persuasion (or just murdering the social worker) then relocate whole family.<br /> <br /> Id like to add, I have no vendetta against Social servies IRL they, play a distasteful, but neccessary function in our society, but the problems seems worth exploring.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 10-05-2017, 09:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T13:20:36-07:00","id":1147558,"title":"","content":"Well, unless it's a massive issue the social worker would make the final call of whether or not the child needs to be taken. So, unless you're flagrantly abusive convincing the one that pays you a visit will likely be enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T13:52:12-07:00","id":1147573,"title":"","content":"How to get his report to make sense in some cases.<br /> <br /> &quot;This young woman of 16 was forced into an arranged Marriage&quot;...<br /> <br /> &quot;This 7 year old is living witha group of teenagers, and an adult, without his parents ok&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;and I think we should leave it alone&quot;<br /> <br /> or is it likely if their charmed enough they'll decide to leave anything problematic off the report.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://