over that bureaucracy. (As part of this, it might mean that person has Dominate, Sovereign, or some other power controlling a person high up in the bureaucracy.)<br /> <br /> Or someone who can control computer systems who can create or kill the electronic paper trail that ends the bureaucracy from doing this.<br /> <br /> Of by knowing enough about the law in question that you can put in some kind of injunction or other tactic to first delay and then entirely stop the bureaucracy from pursuing this. This might be possibly by mundane means, or you may need supernatural powers to make it happen. But the target of that would be outside the bureaucracy into another person or organization.<br /> <br /> If not, the only solution is to realize you'll eventually be defeated. Use your power simply to buy enough time so you can enact your Plan B - absconding with the child and using a cover of the child running away, being kidnapped, or something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T15:38:17-07:00","id":1148918,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn what could a Tziminic do once his Revenant family was on the Radar? <br /> <br /> Tell them &quot;Treat your offspring with kidsgloves in the coming weeks, I know, it will be painful, and injurious to their training, but next time I hear of one of you biting off a finger for misbehaviour... the offender will spend days wishing to die!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.ima